      "id": "claim_5508a1aff46743db9e639c96bd6bb53c",
      "statement": "All prompt templates support asynchronous formatting via ainvoke(dict), aformat_messages(), and aformat() methods. The Runnable interface also provides batch() and astream() for batch processing and async streaming. These operations return the same PromptValue types as their synchronous counterparts.",
