      "id": "claim_a780c9a37b47446d915223c821a90683",
      "statement": "ChatPromptTemplate supports composition via __add__ operator with other ChatPromptTemplate instances, BaseMessage objects, BaseMessagePromptTemplate instances, strings (shorthand for human messages), or lists of messages. The + operator concatenates message lists, merges input variables, and merges partial variables (raising ValueError on conflicts).",
