      "id": "claim_ec6a9f38939749d79aa741dd6931c2ac",
      "statement": "FewShotPromptTemplate and FewShotChatMessagePromptTemplate support both static example lists and dynamic selection via example_selector. The _aget_examples() method enables async example selection; selectors must implement both select_examples(input_variables) and aselect_examples(input_variables) methods.",
