      "statement": "_StringImageMessagePromptTemplate (base for HumanMessagePromptTemplate, AIMessagePromptTemplate, SystemMessagePromptTemplate) formats multimodal content including both StringPromptTemplate, ImagePromptTemplate, and DictPromptTemplate instances into message content arrays with type/text and type/image_url entries.",
