      "id": "claim_44b6b1f0cd8a4b7a8540664c0eff3966",
      "statement": "When a ChatPromptTemplate has exactly one input variable, invoke() automatically wraps non-dict arguments as a single-key dict. This enables passing raw values directly instead of requiring dict construction for single-variable templates.",
